This licence covers the ORIGINAL code and data of the WEV-SMT artifact: the
checker and SMT encoder under src/, the Isabelle/HOL development under isabelle/,
the evaluation drivers and result files under eval/, the synthesis scripts under
research/claimD/, and the top-level README.md and reproduce.sh.

It does NOT cover third-party material redistributed with this artifact, which
remains under its own terms:

  * eval/corpus/Dat3M/**            Dat3M / Dartagnan. MIT-style licence,
                                    Copyright 2019 Hernan Ponce-de-Leon,
                                    Florian Furbach, Natalia Gavrilenko.
                                    See eval/corpus/Dat3M/LICENCE.

  * eval/corpus/herdtools7/**       herdtools7. CeCILL-B Free Software Licence.
                                    Some catalogue subdirectories carry joint
                                    copyright with Arm Ltd; the upstream notice
                                    enumerates them.
                                    See eval/corpus/herdtools7/LICENSE.txt.

Those upstream notices are shipped verbatim and are not superseded, replaced or
relicensed by this file. See eval/corpus/MANIFEST.md for the full inventory of
third-party material and its provenance.

Build-time dependencies resolved by Maven (Z3/JavaSMT, JUnit and their transitive
dependencies) are not redistributed here and remain under their own licences.

